UNATTRIBUTED  ast-LinuxLibSample.json: Not a Joern export: an EXTRACTION. All 7 entries were verified byte-identical to their (name, file) counterparts in ast-LinuxLib.json, which is gitignored and local-only. Commit 5fd17ae describes it as the call-closure of the functions Autoform/SpecsGen/LinuxLibSample.lean names. No extraction script is committed, so there is no exact command to record, and naming cartographer/export_ast.sc plus a Linux source tree would claim a regeneration path that does not produce this file. Attribution requires committing the extractor (and recording the parent AST it selects from).
